                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I first started this game way back in March 2015, and after 11 years, 7 months, and 8 days, I finally returned to it and completed the entire game, earning every achievement!\n\nThis is a truly unique game with a 2D-style art direction blended with some 3D-like elements. The concept is simple, but certain moments can become surprisingly intense. For example, I needed some mushrooms for a late-game quest and thought I was in trouble. Thankfully, with the help of a guide, I was able to find some mushrooms I had overlooked in an earlier section of the map.\n\nMushrooms and eggs can be surprisingly difficult to spot, but that’s part of what makes this such a wonderful hidden-object game. Combined with a great story and a unique visual style, it made for a memorable experience. I'm glad I finally came back to finish what I started all those years ago, and I'm looking forward to playing the other games in the series!",
